### 1. 회원가입
POST https://localhost:7122/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "confirmPassword": "Test1234!"
}

### 2. 로그인
POST https://localhost:7122/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 3. 토큰 갱신
POST https://localhost:7122/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "여기에_리프레시_토큰_붙여넣기"
}

### 4. 캐릭터 생성 (토큰 필요)
POST https://localhost:7122/api/character
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_액세스_토큰_붙여넣기

{
}

### 5. 캐릭터 목록 조회
GET https://localhost:7122/api/character
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_액세스_토큰_붙여넣기

### 6. 특정 캐릭터 조회
GET https://localhost:7122/api/character/캐릭터ID_여기에
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_액세스_토큰_붙여넣기

### 7. 캐릭터 삭제
DELETE https://localhost:7122/api/character/캐릭터ID_여기에
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_액세스_토큰_붙여넣기

### 8. 경험치 획득 (레벨업 테스트)
POST https://localhost:7122/api/character/캐릭터ID_여기에/experience
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_액세스_토큰_붙여넣기

{
  "amount": 150
}

### 9. 스탯 분배
PUT https://localhost:7122/api/character/캐릭터ID_여기에/stats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 여기에_액세스_토큰_붙여넣기

{
  "strength": 2,
  "dexterity": 1,
  "intelligence": 1,
  "vitality": 1
}